    {
      "id": "p0103-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In the English game, Parsnik utters snake sounds such as \"hissss\" during battle. On rare occasion, though, Parsnik will instead say \"herssss\" - a surprise play on the words \"his\" and \"hers\". This joke would be lost in a literal translation, so the translator replaced it with a completely different Japanese joke.",
        "raw": "In the English game, Parsnik utters snake sounds such as \"hissss\" during battle.\nOn rare occasion, though, Parsnik will instead say \"herssss\" - a surprise play\non the words \"his\" and \"hers\". This joke would be lost in a literal translation,\nso the translator replaced it with a completely different Japanese joke.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.09584847,
          0.21972143,
          0.70380426,
          0.28783571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.09358017,
          0.21900714,
          0.70583861,
          0.28890714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          10,
          11,
          12,
          13
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "英语版中，Parsnik 战斗时会发出“hissss”一类的蛇嘶声。但偶尔它会改说“herssss”，突然拿 his（他的）和 hers（她的）开个玩笑。直译会丢掉这个笑话，于是译者换成了一个完全不同的日语笑话。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.09573149,
          0.21829286,
          0.70380426,
          0.29140714
        ],
