    {
      "id": "p0103-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In 2009, a user on a popular Japanese message board started a new message thread titled \"Let's Reveal Our Real Names in this Thread\". The thread began with this post:",
        "raw": "In 2009, a user on a popular Japanese message board started a new\nmessage thread titled \"Let's Reveal Our Real Names in this Thread\". The\nthread began with this post:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.12327153,
          0.64302143,
          0.66822345,
          0.68808571
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.1219492,
          0.64230714,
          0.66954578,
          0.68915714
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          27,
          28,
          29
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "2009年，日本一个热门论坛的用户发起了题为“在这个帖子里公布我们的真名吧”的讨论，开场是这样一条帖子：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
