    {
      "id": "p0103-b008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "Because staying anonymous was central to this message board's culture, the very premise of the thread was ridiculous. The result: over a thousand replies of \"I'm Yuya Sato too, pyaaaa!\", \"What a coincidence, I'm Yuya Sato too!\", and other sarcastic remarks.",
        "raw": "Because staying anonymous was central to this message board's\nculture, the very premise of the thread was ridiculous. The result: over a\nthousand replies of \"I'm Yuya Sato too, pyaaaa!\", \"What a coincidence,\nI'm Yuya Sato too!\", and other sarcastic remarks.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.12366823,
          0.74042857,
          0.66823362,
          0.80232857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.1223459,
          0.73971429,
          0.66955595,
          0.8034
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          32,
          33,
          34,
          35
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "匿名是这个论坛文化的核心，因此帖子的出发点本身就很荒唐。结果出现了上千条“我也叫 Yuya Sato，pyaaaa！”“真巧，我也叫 Yuya Sato！”之类的调侃回复。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
