    {
      "id": "p0103-b009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "The sheer silliness of the thread, its content, and its enormous response transformed the original post into a Japanese Internet legend. To this day, comical references to Yuya Sato's post and nonsensical shout can be seen on Japanese websites and in Japanese entertainment.",
        "raw": "The sheer silliness of the thread, its content, and its enormous response\ntransformed the original post into a Japanese Internet legend. To this\nday, comical references to Yuya Sato's post and nonsensical shout can be\nseen on Japanese websites and in Japanese entertainment.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.12229504,
          0.81459286,
          0.67309572,
          0.87682857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.12097271,
          0.81387857,
          0.67441805,
          0.8779
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          36,
          37,
          38,
          39
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "帖子及内容的荒诞，加上海量回应，让原帖成了日本网络传奇。直到今天，日本网站和娱乐作品仍会拿 Yuya Sato 的帖子和那声莫名其妙的喊叫开玩笑。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
